<title>BELGIUM: Quick to pay 30 Bfr net div for 1996.</title>
<headline>Quick to pay 30 Bfr net div for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian fast food group Quick Restaurants said in a statement on Tuesday it was to pay an unchanged net dividend of 30 Belgian francs a share on 1996 earnings.  </p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on May 28 this year.</p>
<p>In the same statement Quick confirmed the provisional results for 1996 it published in February.</p>
<p>These showed a 48 percent fall in consolidated net profit to 312 million Belgian francs and a 10 percent increase in brand name sales to 21.507 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
